   unofficial fan production for non-commercial purposes made under the
   Indie Stone Terms (https://projectzomboid.com/blog/support/terms-conditions/).
   Project Zomboid and Spiffo belong to The Indie Stone. The SpiffBoy SDK is
   not official and is not affiliated with The Indie Stone.

6. No warranty

   The SpiffBoy SDK is provided as is, without warranty of any kind. Ohhoop
   is not liable for any damage arising from its use.

To ask for a permission, write to Ohhoop on the Steam Workshop page of the
